      "section_id": "introcs.6-1-what-is-an-operating-system",
      "directive": "Explain an operating system’s dual role: providing convenient abstractions/services to programs and users, and managing/protecting hardware resources. Summarize the key services an OS typically offers (execution, I/O, storage, protection) at a high level."
